{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le05ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "A Complaint Letter <br>  <br>Don't forget to include: <br>\n<ul><li> A Greeting\n<li> A Body Paragraph\n<li> Examples", "time": "0", "id": 0}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 4, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "Dear Sir / Madam, <br><br>\nI am writing to air my feelings about our visit to your restaurant, Zanzibar, on the 4th of June. The service was so poor, that our evening was spoiled! <br>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "I called the restaurant last month to book a table at 8  p.m. I later received a confirmation regarding my booking by email that said: <br><br>\n1) we had a window table so we could look out at the  harbor. <br>\n2) my daughters (6 and 8 years old) would receive free children's meals.<br>\n3) there was a special, perfect for vegetarians.", "time": "13000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "When we promptly arrived at the restaurant, the waiter hastily ushered us to a table next to the\nkitchen and away from a view. When I kindly tried to explain that we booked a table\nelsewhere, the waiter swiftly became rude and unhelpful.", "time": "39000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "Secondly, the vegetarian special was not available. This showed a clear lack of\ncommunication on your part. How can you advertise for vegetarians and then not meet those customers' needs?<br>Thirdly, when we asked for the bill, it was incorrect. Our waiter charged the children's meals to my credit card as well! When I pointed out that we were told these would be free of charge, he told me to talk to the manager.", "time": "56000", "id": 4}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "Overall, we felt the ambiance was extremely unwelcoming. Our waiter was unprofessional, inattentive and curt. It was very disappointing indeed.<br>\nI enclose a copy of the bill.<br>\nI look forward to receiving your response.<br><br>Yours faithfully, <br>\nMs. Janine King", "time": "85700", "id": 5}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can write about customer service. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write a customer complaint. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can describe behavior and personality.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you properly completed a customer complaint form before? If yes, when? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " When would a person complete one? What is poor customer service?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: I want to speak to your boss, now!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, 