correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing a Customer Complaint", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here are some example sentences to include in a customer complaint letter.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Greeting</span>: <br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Dear Sir,<br>Dear Madam,<br>Company Name,</span><br/> <br/>Remember to use a comma after the greeting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Closing</span>:<br><br>  If you know the person's name - <span class=\"italic\">Yours sincerely,</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Sincerely yours</span><br> If you don't know the person's name - <span class=\"italic\">Yours truly,</span>or <span class=\"italic\">Yours faithfully,</span> <br><br> <span class=\"strong\"> Phrases you can use to describe a situation</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\"> I am writing to inform you of my dissatisfaction with ...<br> I am writing to inquire about ... <br><br>  </span><span class=\"strong\">Phrases you can use to describe a problem</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I had difficulty in ... <br> On March 1st, I ...</span><br><br>   <span class=\"strong\">Phrases you can use to describe a solution</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I enclose a copy of the invoice ... <br> Could I please ask you to ...</span><br><br> <span class=\"strong\"> Phrase to use to finish you letter of complaint</span><br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I look forward to receiving your response.<br> Please do not hesitate to contact me if you have any more questions.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: She walked slowly.<br> &nbsp;How did she walk? Slowly.</span><br><br>Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:<br> <span class=\"italic\">Examples: sad - sadly, curious - curiously</span><br><br>   Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ally</span>:<br><span class=\"italic\"> Example: comic - comically</span><br><br>  The adverbs <span class=\"strong\">fast</span>, <span class=\"strong\">hard</span>, <span class=\"strong\">well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The waiter hastily ushered us to a table.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I kindly tried to explain that we booked a table elsewhere.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to air ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something known in public  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am writing to air my feelings about our visit to your restaurant, Zanzibar.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a letter of complaint.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "promptly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something without delay ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We promptly arrived at the restaurant at 8 p.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hastily ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "done or made very quickly ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The waiter hastily ushered us to a table next to the kitchen and away from a view. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "swiftly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "done quickly or immediately ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The waiter swiftly became rude and unhelpful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "elsewhere ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in or to another place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I kindly tried to explain that we booked a table elsewhere, the waiter swiftly became rude and unhelpful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ambiance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the mood or feeling of a particular place", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Overall, we felt the ambiance was extremely unwelcoming.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "indeed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without any question", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was very disappointing indeed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "faithfully ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having or showing true and constant trust ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> Yours faithfully,<br/> Ms. Janine King", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Interview a family member about a time they received poor customer service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the details in note form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Then, turn your notes into a 80-100 word customer complaint.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adverbs of manner to describe how things are done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading your customer complaint aloud  when done.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I interview a family member about receiving poor customer service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write down notes from the interview.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a customer complaint.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the customer complaint aloud when done.", "type": "text"}]}]}